{"ticker":"V","updated":"2026-11-07T02:02:00Z","profile":{"longName":"Visa Inc.","shortName":"Visa Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","country":"United States","website":"https://corporate.visa.com","fullTimeEmployees":null,"marketCap":789935357952,"trailingPE":34.306007,"forwardPE":24.677958,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":17.208796,"pegRatio":1.91,"targetMeanPrice":443.4427,"targetHighPrice":500.0,"targetLowPrice":330.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":37,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.132,"earningsGrowth":0.219,"grossMargins":0.97678,"operatingMargins":0.63728,"profitMargins":0.51203996,"totalRevenue":45902999552,"beta":0.786,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":442.23,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":293.89,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.74},"summary":"Visa Inc. operates as a payments technology company in the United States and internationally. It operates VisaNet, a transaction processing network that enables authorization, clearing, and settlement of payment transactions. The company also offers credit, debit, and prepaid card products; tap to pay, tokenization, and click to pay services; Visa Direct, a platform which facilitates money movement, enabling clients to collect, hold, convert, and send funds across its network; and issuing solutions, such as airport lounge access, dining reservations, shopping experiences, event tickets, and seller offers. In addition, it provides acceptance solutions, an omnichannel payment integration with e-commerce platforms; risk detection and prevention solutions; and advisory and other services comprising consulting practice, proprietary analytics models, data scientists and economists, marketing services, and managed services. The company provides its services under the Visa, Visa Electron, V PAY, Interlink, and PLUS brands. It serves consumers, sellers, financial institutions, and government entities. Visa Inc. was founded in 1958 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","summary_zh":"Visa Inc. 是一家在美国和国际上运营的支付技术公司。它經營 VisaNet，這是一個交易處理網路，可實現支付交易的授權、清算和結算。該公司還提供信用卡、金融卡和預付卡產品；點擊支付、標記化和點擊支付服務； Visa Direct，一個促進資金流動的平台，使客戶能夠透過其網路收集、持有、轉換和發送資金；並發布解決方案，例如機場休息室使用權、餐飲預訂、購物體驗、活動門票和賣家購物優惠。此外，它還提供受理解決方案、與電子商務平台的全通路支付整合；風險檢測和預防解決方案；諮詢和其他服務，包括諮詢實踐、專有分析模型、資料科學家和經濟學家、行銷服務和託管服務。該公司以 Visa、Visa Electron、V PAY、Interlink 和 PLUS 品牌提供服務。它为消费者、卖家、金融机构和政府实体提供服务。 Visa Inc. 成立于 1958 年，总部位于加利福尼亚州旧金山。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"信用服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":342.34,"h":344.38,"l":341.0,"c":342.3,"v":4711600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":341.69,"h":346.32,"l":341.29,"c":343.99,"v":4646200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":342.61,"h":342.61,"l":336.44,"c":338.12,"v":6557900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":338.73,"h":343.53,"l":337.87,"c":343.49,"v":5157600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":341.22,"h":343.19,"l":339.17,"c":339.43,"v":3518300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":340.61,"h":342.71,"l":338.39,"c":339.05,"v":4367500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":336.24,"h":340.54,"l":333.47,"c":340.03,"v":5527700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":339.94,"h":346.2,"l":339.52,"c":346.2,"v":5763500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":344.73,"h":345.27,"l":338.18,"c":338.18,"v":7526600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":340.45,"h":342.69,"l":338.25,"c":341.61,"v":13674300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":339.01,"h":344.86,"l":338.66,"c":344.36,"v":5621800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":344.59,"h":345.26,"l":337.63,"c":338.7,"v":10142700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":339.13,"h":339.9,"l":337.92,"c":338.68,"v":5207400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":338.35,"h":340.2,"l":334.51,"c":334.93,"v":5398700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":337.23,"h":339.5,"l":336.23,"c":337.37,"v":9619200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":337.38,"h":340.64,"l":335.55,"c":340.16,"v":7217800},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":339.82,"h":345.61,"l":338.51,"c":341.38,"v":8164400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":340.31,"h":349.36,"l":340.31,"c":347.83,"v":8381000},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":346.22,"h":347.18,"l":343.56,"c":345.95,"v":5198000},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":346.11,"h":353.16,"l":346.0,"c":349.84,"v":5199700},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":350.01,"h":351